# Minime preloaded-ROM folder mapping (single source of truth).
#
# Format: short_name|roms_dir
#
# short_name is the source dir inside roms/ that holds the actual preloaded
# roms (e.g. roms/gb/).  roms_dir is the single canonical Roms/ folder name
# used by BOTH UIs — it mirrors MinUI's canonical names exactly
# (skeleton/BASE/Roms/ + skeleton/EXTRAS/Roms/ in the MinUI submodule).
# Allium resolves roms by the (ABBREV) tag, so no per-UI naming is needed.
#
# Consumed at build time by roms/install.sh (preloaded-ROM staging, UI-agnostic).

gb|Game Boy (GB)
gbc|Game Boy Color (GBC)
gba|Game Boy Advance (GBA)
nes|Nintendo Entertainment System (FC)
snes|Super Nintendo Entertainment System (SFC)
md|Sega Genesis (MD)
gg|Sega Game Gear (GG)
sms|Sega Master System (SMS)
psx|Sony PlayStation (PS)
pce|TurboGrafx-16 (PCE)
saturn|Sega Saturn (SAT)
lynx|Atari Lynx (LYNX)
ngp|Neo Geo Pocket (NGP)
wswan|WonderSwan (WS)
nds|Nintendo DS (NDS)
a2600|Atari 2600 (ATARI)
